    subgraph Proposed_Marketplace["Proposed Future Architecture: Farmer Transactional Marketplace [PLANNED - NOT IMPLEMENTED]"]
        direction TB
        
        P_List["Phase 2: Farmer Listing & Catalog<br/>- Farmer lists commodity, quantity (Quintals), harvesting date, expected price<br/>- Uploads quality photos & location pin"]
        
        P_Enquiry["Phase 2: Buyer Discovery & Direct Enquiry<br/>- Wholesale traders, local retailers (F2B) & consumers (F2C) search listings<br/>- In-app negotiated price offers & quantity bids"]
        
        P_Order["Phase 3: Formal Order Creation & Escrow<br/>- Smart order contract generated with terms, delivery date, transport clause<br/>- Buyer deposits funds into secure Escrow (UPI / NetBanking / Razorpay)"]
        
        P_Quality["Phase 3: Quality Check & Logistics<br/>- Digital grade inspection (AGMARK standard)<br/>- Rural logistics dispatch & transport tracking"]
        
        P_Fulfill["Phase 3: Delivery Confirmation & Payout<br/>- Buyer verifies arrival and quality at destination<br/>- Escrow releases 100% payment directly to Farmer's bank account<br/>- Dispute resolution window if grade mismatch occurs"]
        
        P_Analytics["Phase 4: Verified Network & Credit Scoring<br/>- Trust scores, repeat transaction histories<br/>- Transaction-backed Kisan Credit scoring for low-interest bank loans"]
        
        P_List --> P_Enquiry --> P_Order --> P_Quality --> P_Fulfill --> P_Analytics
    end

    M5 -.->|Proposed Strategic Transition| P_List

